    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE UMBRELLA, ANNIHILATE DEMONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>Intense and Frenetic</strong> action-platformer roguelike where quick reflexes and creativity are essential to survive against hordes of <strong>Demons</strong>. Step into the paws of a <strong>Cat with a Raincoat</strong>, embarking on this infernal journey using his trusty <strong>Umbrella</strong> to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging stages filled with brutal enemies and upgrades to transform your playstyle based on your chosen umbrella. Defeat enemies to earn: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Hearts</strong>, which can be used to unlock permanent skills and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Drops</strong>, which can be used to shop at a <strong>Shady Vendor</strong> and a <strong>Blessed Statue</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WANT TO TEST YOUR LIMITS?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive against endless hordes of enemies to <strong>Beat Your High Scores</strong> and climb to the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T FORGET!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats don't like getting wet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to carve your path through the underworld and reclaim your soul?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE UMBRELLA, ANNIHILATE DEMONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>Intense and Frenetic</strong> action-platformer roguelike where quick reflexes and creativity are essential to survive against hordes of <strong>Demons</strong>. Step into the paws of a <strong>Cat with a Raincoat</strong>, embarking on this infernal journey using his trusty <strong>Umbrella</strong> to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9ea6f38c7d79fdf48073d4978e1f8bd7.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging stages filled with brutal enemies and upgrades to transform your playstyle based on your chosen umbrella. Defeat enemies to earn: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Hearts</strong>, which can be used to unlock permanent skills and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Drops</strong>, which can be used to shop at a <strong>Shady Vendor</strong> and a <strong>Blessed Statue</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/9fe03e7e3de53cd1027464e1ec98224a.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WANT TO TEST YOUR LIMITS?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive against endless hordes of enemies to <strong>Beat Your High Scores</strong> and climb to the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.poster.avif?t=1755200122\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.webm?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/de21f06855fd30460849b30a30ed1737.mp4?t=1755200122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T FORGET!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats don't like getting wet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to carve your path through the underworld and reclaim your soul?</p>",
